{"ticker":"DELHIVERY","symbol":"DELHIVERY","instrumentId":3180183,"name":"Delhivery","industry":"NSE-Transportation-Logistics","about":"Delhivery is an integrated logistics and supply chain company providing express parcel delivery, heavy goods transportation, part-truckload (PTL) and truckload (TL) freight, warehousing, cross-border logistics, and supply chain software solutions. Its services also include e-commerce returns management, payment collection, installation and assembly, and fraud detection. The company supports businesses across e-commerce, FMCG, consumer durables, electronics, automotive, healthcare, retail, and industrial sectors through its technology-driven logistics platform. Delhivery operates a nationwide logistics network comprising automated sort centres, gateways, fulfilment and delivery centres, enabling 24x7 operations and servicing over 18,850 PIN codes across all Indian states.","website":"www.delhivery.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:15:36.435Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":456.7,"changePct":1.6017797552836461,"week52High":520.3,"week52Low":370},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹34,250 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹11,652 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"749,948,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"378"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"640,523,465"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.53"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"0.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.04"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.16"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"184.9"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"143–4,069"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"1.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"12.18"},{"label":"Volume","value":"2,332,604"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"3,220,095"},{"label":"Master score","value":"73"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"31"},{"label":"Pric